  "price": 125.45,
  "currency": "USD",
  "providerTimestamp": "2026-10-20T15:30:00Z",
  "delayed": false
}
```

Dimensiune estimată: **200 bytes per înregistrare**.

**Price history:**

```json
{
  "symbol": "EXM",
  "timestamp": "2026-10-20T15:30:00Z",
  "open": 125.10,
  "high": 125.70,
  "low": 124.90,
